MODULE: AbortRollsBudgetWindow
TARGET: ProbeReadOnly
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an aborted Merkle walk resets the remediation traffic budget
PERTURBS: LocaliseAbort

--- FIND
    /\ loc' = {}
    /\ UNCHANGED dataVars
    /\ UNCHANGED locEpoch
    /\ UNCHANGED envVars /\ UNCHANGED guardVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ loc' = {}
    /\ consumed' = 0
    /\ UNCHANGED dataVars
    /\ UNCHANGED locEpoch
    /\ UNCHANGED envVars /\ UNCHANGED <<failures, open, cooled>>
--- END
